34
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:26,900
Lyra: Can't... stop...

35
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:28,200
Kael: Hope... a flicker.

36
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:29,500
Lyra: Almost... there!

37
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:34,800
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Nexus - Ambush, dread.

38
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:36,100
